# {{svc}}

DDD six-module Maven microservice skeleton generated by start.spring.io (`ddd-six-module`).

## Modules

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `{{svc}}-contract` | DTOs / constants / enums (zero Spring runtime deps) |
| `{{svc}}-feign-client` | Feign API + fallback (optional OpenFeign) |
| `{{svc}}-domain` | Pure Java domain |
| `{{svc}}-infrastructure` | MyBatis-Plus persistence |
| `{{svc}}-application` | Controllers / app services |
| `{{svc}}-bootstrap` | Spring Boot main + `application.yml` + Flyway |

## Build

```bash
./mvnw -pl {{svc}}-bootstrap -am package
```

